  "title": "RideNow Group, Inc. Announces Expansion of Powersports Dealership, New Superstore in Gainesville, Florida",
  "summary": "GAINESVILLE, Fla., June 2, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — RideNow Group, Inc. (NASDAQ: RDNW) (“we”, “our”, the “Company”, or “RideNow”), a leading U.S. powersports vehicle retailer, today announced the opening of a new flagship facility for RideNow Powersports Gainesville. Relocating from its former site at 4820 NW 13th Street to 4222 NW 13th Street, Gainesville, Florida, the […]",
